# UI And Frontend Standards

Use existing LiNKaios routes and components before creating new UI.

Prefer shadcn/ui, Tailwind, existing `packages/ui`, and reusable patterns from `LiNKapps/packages/ui` / `@starter/ui` where appropriate.

Do not rebuild the design system during the MVO.

MVO UI requirements are functional traceability and operator clarity, not pixel-perfect polish.

The dashboard should make the lead-to-preview-site flow visible:

- lead
- bot
- capability lease/run
- LiNKautowork workflow
- LiNKbrain event/audit
- preview site
- CRM/Plane status
- errors/blockers
